### Feature: Giới hạn max_pending_appointments = 3 lịch PENDING / patient (Phase 6)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ========================================
### 0. Đăng ký + đăng nhập patient test
### ========================================
# @name registerPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "max-pending@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "fullName": "Max Pending Test",
  "phone": "0900000022"
}

###

# @name loginPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "max-pending@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

@patientToken = {{loginPatient.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ========================================
### 1-3. Đặt 3 lịch PENDING liên tiếp (ngày khác nhau để tránh conflict slot) → mỗi cái expect 200
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-07-13",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "notes": "pending 1/3"
}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-07-14",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "notes": "pending 2/3"
}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-07-15",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "notes": "pending 3/3"
}

###

### ========================================
### 4. Lịch PENDING thứ 4 → expect 400 "Đã đạt giới hạn 3 lịch hẹn đang chờ"
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-07-16",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "notes": "pending 4/3 - phải bị từ chối"
}

